# village.vb — friendly villager life

when player trades with villager
    give player apple
    tell player Thanks for trading

when player shears a sheep
    give player 3 wool
    announce A sheep was sheared

when player milks a cow
    give player milk

when player eats a golden apple
    heal player to full
    announce That looks tasty

when player is in the village
    warn player You are home
